  forward-reference completion (bsc#1282492)
  * CVE-2026-91776: jackson-databind: Retains every
  unknown raw type ID (bsc#1282491)
  * CVE-2026-83557: jackson-databind: Comparable missing
  from DefaultBaseTypeLimitingValidator's unsafe base
  types (incomplete PolymorphicTypeValidator
  denylist) (bsc#1278008)
